---
description: Trigger skill-first refactor behavior for legacy JavaFX code
globs:
  - "**/*.java"
alwaysApply: false
---
# Refactor trigger

When a file smells like legacy JavaFX living inside a JRebirth application, restructure step by step:

- identify which part of the JRebirth role split is missing
- move state to Model
- move node creation to View
- move event wiring to Controller
- move actions to Command or Service
- move cross-feature messaging to Waves

Use `jrebirth-ai-kit/skills/jrebirth-refactor-legacy/SKILL.md` before editing many files at once.
